    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, you recall talents you had in a previous life. When you finish a long rest, you gain one skill or tool proficiency of your choice. When you finish a long rest, you can replace this proficiency with another one.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-M1sfx47YQm1h8fPF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Give yourself the chosen proficiency on the character sheet (Skills or Tools), and change it after a long rest if you like.</p></section>",
